<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hambrecht goes cold on networking.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hambrecht goes cold on networking.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it cut its rating on several leading networking stocks including Cisco Systems Inc, Cabletron Systems Inc and Fore Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said analyst Farrokh Billimoria cut both Cisco and Cabletron to buy from strong buy and reduced Fore to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
